│ independently associated with peak V˙o2 \u2009≤14\u2009ml\xa0kg -1 \xa0min -1 {odds ratio (OR) 1.69 [1.12-3.55]; P   │
│ =0.01} and heart rate recovery\u2009≤6 (OR 2.02 [1.30-3.14]; P <0.01). However, HR\u2009>\u200987 was not associated │
