resuscitation when applicable). Patient preoperative characteristics, intraoperative management and outcome were        
evaluated for associations with acute kidney injury using an univariate and multiple logistic regression model. RESULTS 
A total of 1597 patients were admitted to the PACU and of these, 1166 met the inclusion criteria. Eighty-seven patients 
